  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim.name
    _text: Steady Aim 1
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim.description
    _text: Each arrow you loose standing still deals +5% damage, up to 5 times. Moving
      or rolling resets it.
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim-2.name
    _text: Steady Aim 2
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim-2.description
    _text: "Standing arrows add 14% damage per stack, up to 5 stacks. The first arrow after stopping deals double damage. Moving or rolling resets stacks."
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim-3.name
    _text: Steady Aim 3
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim-3.description
    _text: "Standing arrows add 16% damage per stack, up to 5 stacks. The first arrow after stopping still deals double damage."
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim-4.name
    _text: Steady Aim 4
  - _key: skill.marksman.steady-aim-4.description
    _text: "At 5 standing-arrow stacks, take 20% less damage. Moving or rolling resets the stacks."
