    _text: Binding Shot 2
  - _key: skill.marksman.binding-shot-2.description
    _text: "Bound stun lasts 1.0 s longer."
  - _key: skill.marksman.binding-shot-3.name
    _text: Binding Shot 3
  - _key: skill.marksman.binding-shot-3.description
    _text: "Binding Shot cooldown is reduced by 3 s."
  - _key: skill.marksman.hunters-snare.name
    _text: Hunter's Snare
  - _key: skill.marksman.hunters-snare.description
    _text: When an enemy gets close, drop a trap. The first to step on it is rooted
      and hurt.
