  - _key: skill.marksman.hunters-snare-3.name
    _text: Hunter's Snare 3
  - _key: skill.marksman.hunters-snare-3.description
    _text: Snare roots another 0.5 s longer. Hunter's Snare cooldown is reduced by
      2 s.
  - _key: skill.marksman.killshot.name
